+/**
+ * Clear the active buffer while retaining the complete cursor row as row zero.
+ *
+ * Preserves X, pending wrap, current pen, modes, margins and saved cursor.
+ * Clears history and fills following rows with default cells. References and
+ * selections in this buffer are invalidated; the inactive buffer is untouched.
+ * Image placements are cleared, but transmitted images remain reusable.
+ * No PTY input is sent. Allocation failure leaves the existing buffer intact.
+ *
+ * If history is empty and Y is already zero, this is a true no-op.
+ * On success, optional out_cleared reports whether storage actually changed.
+ * This is an additive Terax host-clear-v1 extension.
+ *
+ * @ingroup terminal
+ */
+GHOSTTY_API GhosttyResult ghostty_terminal_clear_preserving_cursor_row(
+    GhosttyTerminal terminal, bool* out_cleared);
+
